# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# C++ build dirs & artifacts (patterns un-anchored → match at any depth,
# so engine/order-matching-engine/build/ etc. are covered)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
build-*/
cmake-build-*/
out/
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
compile_commands.json
Testing/
_deps/
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.exe
*.out
*.dSYM/

# Debug & profiling
*.pdb
perf.data
perf.data.old
*.gcda
*.gcno
*.gcov
callgrind.out.*
cachegrind.out.*

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
